WEBVTT

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:26.170
Saint Seiya

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:34.770
Beyond tens of billions of light years.

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:37.630
Past immense darkness.

00:01:37.870 --> 00:01:40.270
The world you reach upstream
the Acheron River.

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:48.940
The infinite pasture near the Lethe River.

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:55.780
The utopia only those chosen
by God can enter after death.

00:01:56.600 --> 00:02:00.710
Where there is no hunger,
war, suffering or sadness.

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:06.640
A haven of eternal peace free from evil.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:10.650
It is called Elysion.

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:14.320
Now, playtime is over.

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:16.920
I'll be merciful and finish you off.

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:21.400
I can't die. I still can't die yet.

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:26.730
I still have something I need to do.
I still have someone I want to meet!

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:28.860
Die, Pegasus!

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:30.580
Burn!

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:31.900
My Cosmo!

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:34.050
Pegasus Meteor!

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:38.940
Did you think you can defeat
me with that attack?

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:44.030
What? Pegasus' meteors
are converging into one.

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.210
What's this attack?

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:49.540
Pegasus!

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:50.150
Pegasus!

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:51.610
Comet!

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:06.470
Golden Reinforcement

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:14.380
She is Seika?

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:18.370
Seiya's sister.

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:20.930
I'm relieved.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:24.950
Seiya has been looking for you.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:27.520
Do you know how happy he'll
be when he hears the news?

00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:29.290
It's no use, Shina,

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:31.840
talking about Seiya.

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:33.320
What?

00:03:33.890 --> 00:03:37.290
She doesn't even know who she is.

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:40.490
What do you mean?

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:43.340
She has amnesia.

00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:48.940
Amnesia?

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:55.720
Yes. She's been living in Rodorio
village since after losing her memory.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:04:00.030
In Rodorio, near the Sanctuary?

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:04.570
When she was young, when Seiya
was sent to the Sanctuary.

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:08.130
Seika followed him and came around here.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:16.140
But area around the Sanctuary is too rough
for an average person to pass through.

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:24.820
While she wandered she slipped off a cliff,

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:26.020
hit her head and passed out.

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:29.550
Luckily, she was found

00:04:29.550 --> 00:04:34.220
by an old man from Rodorio
village, who was passing by.

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:39.530
The shock from the incident
lead to her memory loss.

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:45.620
She figured out her name was Seika by
looking through her own belongings.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:46.520
SEIKA

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:51.510
But she did not know who she
was and why she was there.
SEIKA

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:56.800
Months went by helping
the old man run his shop.

00:04:57.720 --> 00:04:59.520
The two were living

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:03.590
so close to each other without knowing it.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:05.290
But, Marin,

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:09.430
how did you find her?

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:13.880
Even the Grande Foundation
wasn't able to find her.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.670
I heard the Grande Foundation
ramped up their efforts

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:18.410
and cast a search in Japan.

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:21.790
I've heard the same day
Seiya was sent to Greece,

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:24.950
Seika suddenly went missing.

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:29.160
Seiya's sister is not in Japan.

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:32.240
She must have followed Seiya here.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:34.750
That was my hunch.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:39.480
After all, they're siblings.
They only have one another.

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:42.190
There's no way she could have sat still.

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:43.960
Marin.

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:46.670
I've also heard that

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:50.750
you've been looking for
your long-lost brother.

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:53.440
Marin, Seiya is...

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:57.100
Seiya thinks you might be his sister.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:04.000
Seiya.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:10.210
The comet.

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:13.850
The comet I unleashed with all
my strength has no effect.

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:18.820
My last bit of strength is draining out.

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:21.870
Let me tell you, I'm the God of Death who

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:25.160
has been at Lord Hades'
side since ancient times.

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:28.850
Even if you hit God with all your might.

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:31.800
You can't even put in a scratch, fool!

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:35.440
Now you understand the differences
between God and mortal.

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:36.840
Die!

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:40.470
What?

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:43.830
These light traces of blood.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.960
Scratches.

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:49.430
Scratches caused by the comet.

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:52.240
I will not forgive you!

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:58.400
Even if they're just scratches,

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:00.860
a worm like you cannot

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:03.720
wound the body of God.

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:07.250
Thrashing your body won't be enough!

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:11.970
I'll crash you into pieces and
spread you across the dimensions.

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:16.490
I'll make sure you will suffer
eternally after death.

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:18.690
Die, Pegasus!

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:24.480
No, that's still not enough.

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:27.660
He needs to suffer more.

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:31.470
I'll tear your mind along with your flesh.

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:35.610
Yes. Death will follow that.

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:43.800
Miss, are you all right?

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:45.610
What's wrong, Kiki?

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:49.350
I don't know, she was suddenly in pain.

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:53.790
It hurts. It feels like my
body is being ripped apart.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:07:59.470
What's happening?

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:08.300
I will kill your sister, Pegasus.

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:11.270
What did you say?

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:15.580
Perhaps you can't hear me in your condition.

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:17.250
I said before I kill you,

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:22.740
I will kill your sister who
is in the Sanctuary on Earth.

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:27.660
Sister is in the Sanctuary?

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:31.450
No, no way!

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:35.260
Look closely.

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:40.670
You will die anyway.

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:44.460
I'll let you see Earth one last time.

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:54.350
It's sister. It's my sister!

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:56.780
It's my sister, Seika!

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:02.250
Sister! What's this?

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:07.110
As God of Death, the target that I select

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:10.390
will die without direct contact.

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:14.180
Even if they are millions
of light years away.

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:18.700
Now, Pegasus.

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:22.420
Watch your sister suffer

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:23.440
and die on Earth.

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:25.480
Stop it, Thanatos!

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:33.530
When will you learn?

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:36.620
You shouldn't have energy left to move.

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:40.980
Now, watch your sister
die with your own eyes.

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:47.430
Miss.

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:48.990
Keep it together, Seika.

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:51.870
What is going on?

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:54.340
I have no idea.

00:09:56.390 --> 00:09:57.700
What's wrong, Kiki?

00:09:58.440 --> 00:09:59.380
I feel it.

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:02.600
An enormous Cosmo.

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:05.640
I have never seen such a terrifying Cosmo.

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:09.150
It's like it engulfs everything with death.

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:11.240
Watch out!

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:17.080
Kiki!

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:20.620
Kiki.

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:22.560
What happened, Kiki?

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:26.480
A huge ball of fire

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:28.950
was about to hit Seika.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:31.730
We couldn't see anything.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:36.090
The one who's been making her suffer

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:38.030
is also him.

00:10:39.520 --> 00:10:44.720
You were able to sense it
because of your psychokinesis.

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:47.690
But who is it?

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:49.620
For what purpose?

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:53.220
It's here again!

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:55.340
This time from the other side!

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:57.600
It's coming right for Seika!

00:10:58.560 --> 00:10:59.730
Over here.

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.070
Marin!

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.380
Marin!

00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:09.400
Are you all right, Marin?

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:14.590
I won't let Seika die

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:17.560
until Seiya meets her.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:24.410
Worms, don't waste your time.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:28.870
I heard a voice from the sky.

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:33.660
I will kill Pegasus' sister

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:36.830
no matter how much you try to stop me.

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:38.810
What did you say?

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:41.030
Who are you?

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:45.110
I am God of Death, Thanatos.

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:50.370
I was just about to dispose of
Seiya who trespassed into Elysion.

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:53.010
What? Seiya?

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:55.980
Seiya has reached Elysion?

00:11:56.460 --> 00:12:01.300
Tearing Pegasus' flesh isn't enough
to repay for his sins against God.

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:05.940
So before I bury him, I will kill his sister!

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:08.900
Now, get out of the way, you worms!

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:11.730
Look out, right side this time!

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:23.950
Thanatos, I won't let you do as you please.

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:27.040
I will not give you Seika's life!

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:29.590
That's right! That's exactly right!

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:40.540
We will protect Seiya's sister!

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:41.650
Seiya.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:44.210
Do you hear our voices, Seiya?

00:12:44.210 --> 00:12:47.990
We will guard your sister's life with ours.

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:49.960
We will protect her no matter what.

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:52.460
So fight with assurance, Seiya!

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:53.800
You can do it, Seiya!

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:55.440
That's right, Seiya!

00:12:55.440 --> 00:13:08.860
Seiya!

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:11.830
Everyone.

00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:18.320
Fools. What can a group of worms do?

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:22.780
Now, Pegasus, watch your
sister's final moments.

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:24.750
Stop it!

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:31.810
What?

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:37.610
They've combined their
Cosmo to create a shield.

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:43.520
Fine, if you all want to die,
I will take care of you first!

00:13:56.330 --> 00:14:00.450
You guys! I can't sacrifice all your lives!

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:05.660
Pegasus, you can still move?

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:07.050
Take this, Thanatos.

00:14:07.050 --> 00:14:08.460
My final attack!

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:09.680
What?

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:12.410
Pegasus Rolling Crush!

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:20.440
Pegasus, are you trying to commit suicide?

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:21.470
What?

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:23.820
Thanatos has disappeared!

00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:35.760
Getting hit by your own attack,
how incompetent can you be?

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:41.390
Forget moving, you can't even talk.

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:45.690
Your friends on Earth also don't have
the energy to protect Seika any longer.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:49.950
It is all coming to the end.

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:01.540
In this case, it doesn't
matter whom I kill first.

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:05.120
Pegasus, will you go first, or
will it be your sister, Seika?

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:13.730
I'm tired of thinking. I'll
kill you both at once.

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:14.790
Die!

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:25.480
I won't let you kill them so easily.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:30.530
I heard there were other
scum Saint trespassers.

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:31.940
Are you one of them?

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:35.440
But this chain is no use!

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:41.340
Take this!

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:44.730
Rolling Defense!

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:51.910
No way...

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:56.100
The chain not only didn't work, but it broke.

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:57.880
How many of you left?

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:02.310
How many trespassers are there
besides you and Pegasus?

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:07.500
If you don't want to
answer, you don't have to.

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:09.860
Die along with Pegasus!

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:14.290
What? Another one!

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.110
Take this!

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:18.990
Rising Dragon!

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:21.990
What?

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:25.630
You've come to die, too!

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:34.730
You must be the last one.

00:16:38.770 --> 00:16:39.680
What?

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:43.960
Half of my body is frozen! What is this?

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:50.010
Diamond Dust!

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:53.990
Shiryu!

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:55.870
Are you all right?

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:57.140
Hyoga.

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:01.740
Fool!

00:17:09.010 --> 00:17:12.870
Did you intend to defeat
me with that weak chill?

00:17:13.270 --> 00:17:15.110
If you want to freeze me,

00:17:15.110 --> 00:17:18.530
you need to get to a couple hundred
times below absolute zero.

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:26.790
Now, are they all of the Saints
who have broken into Elysion?

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:41.210
There's still one left. And you are?

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:43.320
Phoenix Ikki.

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:46.420
I have come to get revenge on
behalf of the dead in hell.

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:49.380
You've come to get revenge?

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:50.860
That's right.

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:55.110
This fist holds the grudges

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:57.720
of those who had been wronged by you.

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:06.930
Take this! Thanatos!

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:12.880
This is the permit to the
Underworld only given to Pandora.

00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:17.670
So Pandora asked you to get
revenge, and you're obligated?

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:18.660
Fool!

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:30.820
I am God of Death.

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:34.040
I don't have the time to deal
with the grudges of the dead.

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:39.030
Unfortunately, I don't believe in God.

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:40.250
What?

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:44.940
I will never acknowledge
an evil God like you!

00:18:46.340 --> 00:18:48.920
Feel the gust of the Phoenix's wings!

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:50.870
Flying Phoenix!

00:18:53.970 --> 00:18:55.070
What?

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:05.090
The Flying Phoenix that I put
all my strength didn't work.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:09.620
You're a little better than the other four.

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:12.300
But you shouldn't have blown off the mask.

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:15.860
You're the first one to make me serious.

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:22.010
Learn the consequence of an angered God!

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:25.710
Terrible Providence!

00:19:32.220 --> 00:19:36.080
Normally, I would cut up your body in pieces

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:38.500
and scatter them across the universe.

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:43.570
But in Elysion, bloodshed would
be disrespectful to Lord Hades.

00:19:43.730 --> 00:19:46.420
I will just cut your head off

00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:49.710
and toss it to the boiling river in hell!

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:52.150
Die!

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.270
What's this sound?

00:19:56.260 --> 00:19:57.900
A resonance?

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:01.280
The sound is coming from hell.

00:20:05.690 --> 00:20:07.850
Could this resonance be

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:11.750
the cry of the twelve Gold Cloths?

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:17.860
I see. I've heard the Gold Cloths have

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:20.300
saved you and lead you to victory before.

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:22.470
Does this mean

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:26.910
the Gold Cloths are trying
to come to your rescue?

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:30.920
But to get from hell to Elysion,

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:33.090
you need the power of God.

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:37.250
So it's impossible for the Gold
Cloths to save you this time.

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:41.500
Then that means these Gold
Cloths are lamenting.

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:59.190
Your last resort, Gold Cloths, will not come.

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:01.670
You have nothing left.

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:06.920
Now, I'll finish five
of you off at once. Die!

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:25.290
That's the end.

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:29.870
What's this enormous Cosmo?

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:34.880
Impossible! The Gold Cloths
are nearing Elysion!

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:39.940
How? How can this happen?

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:42.890
This is...

00:21:54.100 --> 00:21:55.300
The Gold Cloths.

00:21:55.300 --> 00:21:57.160
Have crossed the other dimensions.

00:21:57.160 --> 00:21:59.270
To come and help us.

00:22:01.940 --> 00:22:04.430
The Sagittarius Cloth!

00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:08.510
The Aquarius Cloth!

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:12.350
The Libra Cloth!

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:16.280
The Virgo Cloth!

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:20.050
The Leo Cloth!

00:22:20.990 --> 00:22:24.110
Us five, together with the
spirit of the Gold Saints,

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:26.410
have donned the Gold Cloths!

00:24:04.190 --> 00:24:07.030
The Gold Cloths arrive,
traveling through dimensions.

00:24:07.030 --> 00:24:09.330
Despite combining all of our attacks,

00:24:09.330 --> 00:24:12.040
will the gods still destroy our last hope?

00:24:12.370 --> 00:24:15.380
Just as we were losing consciousness,
we hear a voice...

00:24:15.610 --> 00:24:17.680
That's right. I will not give up.

